  SNYK-JS-GLOB-22112102:
    - '@nestjs/cli > *':
        reason: >-
          Only glob 14.0.2 is fixed, a breaking major that the Nest CLI
          (13.x, even in 11.0.24) and Jest (10.x) don't accept. Dev-only, and
          the flaw needs a caller that cancels a walk with an AbortSignal;
          neither tool passes one, so the abort path never runs.
        expires: 2027-01-14T00:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-11-05T17:27:30.000Z
    - jest > *:
        reason: >-
          Only glob 14.0.2 is fixed, a breaking major that the Nest CLI
          (13.x, even in 11.0.24) and Jest (10.x) don't accept. Dev-only, and
          the flaw needs a caller that cancels a walk with an AbortSignal;
          neither tool passes one, so the abort path never runs.
        expires: 2027-01-14T00:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-11-05T17:27:30.000Z
    - ts-jest > *:
        reason: >-
          Only glob 14.0.2 is fixed, a breaking major that the Nest CLI
          (13.x, even in 11.0.24) and Jest (10.x) don't accept. Dev-only, and
          the flaw needs a caller that cancels a walk with an AbortSignal;
